# Week 1 – Moneyball: IPL Player Valuation

## Project Title
Moneyball: IPL Player Valuation

## Objective
To analyse IPL player performance and auction prices using Data Science and Visualization.

## Week 1 Activities
- Select the project topic.
- Identify suitable IPL datasets.
- Review the available data.
- Set up the GitHub repository.

## Dataset
The initial datasets selected are:
- Auction data
- IPL match data
- Top 100 batsmen statistics
- Top 100 bowlers statistics

## Tools
- Python
- Google Colab
- Pandas
- NumPy
- GitHub
